"""Children's stories — Hinduism and Christianity (v2). English + Hindi for every story.

Format per story: S(code, emoji, palette, values, ref, scenes, en=(title, lesson, [4 scene texts]), hi=(...)).
`ref` = (scripture code, book, chapter, verse) of a verse in the catalogue. Art tokens are drawn by the app.
Prophets and sacred figures are shown only through generic characters and scenery.
"""


def S(code, emoji, palette, values, ref, scenes, **tr):
    return dict(code=code, emoji=emoji, palette=palette, values=values, ref=ref, scenes=scenes, tr=tr)


